<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia 2009 T-bond yld averages 7.455 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia 2009 T-bond yld averages 7.455 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of today's A$600 million T-bond tender, announced by Reserve Bank of Australia (RBA):</p>
<p>  Stock	   Offering	    Allotted	  Avg yield   Range</p>
<p>  7.5 Sep 2009  AS400 million    A$400 million     7.455     7.45-7.46</p>
<p>(RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 60)  </p>
<p>  Stock	  Offering		Allotted	 Avg yield   Range</p>
<p>  7.0 Apr 2000 AS200 million     A$200 million     6.690     6.69 only</p>
<p>		   (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 100)</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
